  - created_at: "2026-10-07T09:41:17.193Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "TDD red reproduced in both real SHA-1 and SHA-256 custom Git driver runs: conflicting cherry-pick receives kind merge when ORIG_HEAD is stale but equal to HEAD. The same keeper retains actual plain-merge signal and exact ours proof. Green linked tests now cover real merge/cherry-pick/revert, missing and malformed signal, missing/mismatched origin, both rebase backends, changed-state/concurrency, and interrupted audited settlement. Git upstream builtin/merge.c sets GITHEAD_<incoming object ID> before its strategy and ORIG_HEAD update; the capture requires this operation-specific signal without persisting branch labels. Full coverage/static/type and packed acceptance are rerun before closure."
  - created_at: "2026-10-07T09:53:50.691Z"
